sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Gateway
    participant Auth
    participant Api
    participant Mongo

    User->>Gateway: HTTP Request
    Gateway->>Auth: Validate JWT (issuer-based)
    Auth-->>Gateway: Token Valid
    Gateway->>Api: Forward Request
    Api->>Mongo: Query Data
    Mongo-->>Api: Result
    Api-->>Gateway: Response
    Gateway-->>User: JSON Response
